  "བགྲོད་པ": [
    "<b style=\"color:#0055aa;\">[Rangjung Yeshe]:</b> {bgrod pa, bgrod pa, bgrod pa, bgrod} intr. v.; 1) walk, *, journey, traversing, march [a six month period]. 2) movement, course,. 3) to wander, cross, walk, *, journey, traverse, pass over, progress, reach. 4) to have intercourse with. traveled"
