    "<b style=\"color:#0055aa;\">[Rangjung Yeshe]:</b> imp. of {rten pa}; support, basis, foundation, site, dwelling place, abode; physical form, body; ordination; re presentation, shrine, holy object, object of worship; to depend on, have recourse to; symbol; a shrine/ a support, prop/ to depend on, rely upon; support(ing element of a mandala); (working) basis; offering; \"support\", a technical term for physical embodiments of enlightened body, speech or mind, a hold, support, base, support, basis, foundation, site, dwelling place, abode, an individual, physical form, ordination, means of salvation, what is founded, cultivation, receptacle, representation, shrine, holy object, object of worship, to depend on, have recourse to, symbol; bzod pa'i rten - catalyst for developing patience"
  ],
  "སྐྱེས་བུ": [
